+# CI Admin Runbook — zizmor 60-finding workflow hardening plan (WO #1776)
+
+Task ID: bridge-20261028-ci1776-zizmor-runbook-r1
+Refs: #1776 (P1-high, radar R35 / SCOUT_RADAR_2026-10-28-XI), #1736, #1712, #1643
+Lane: **report-only, admin-owned patch.** Agents never edit `.github/**` (#1643 doctrine; #1769 live-proves bridge rejection). This document carries the corrected evidence, the resolved pin table, and the exact edit plan so the admin patch is mechanical.
+Scan baseline honesty: original scan receipt dated 2026-10-28 at HEAD 3daacf1 (zizmor 1.31.1). This runbook re-validates at current HEAD and corrects one undercount (Section 2).
+
+---
+
